SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: Let's Ride Ohio - The Western Reserve Greenway
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThe Western Reserve Green
 way Trail is a 47 mile paved trail that runs\, through the countryside\, f
 rom Ashtabula\, Ohio to Warren\, Ohio. [Western Reserve Greenway Trail | A
 shtabula County Metroparks](https://www.ashtabulametroparks.com/westernres
 ervegreenwaytrail)\n\nFriday\, Sep 25th-Sunday\, Sep 27th\nFairfield by Ma
 rriott Inn and Suites is located within a 0.6 mile ride to the Western Res
 erve Greenway Trail.\n2782 Sidley Ct\, Austinburg\, OH 44010\nFree deluxe 
 breakfast every morning.\nIndoor pool Free Wi-Fi\nCall to make your reserv
 ation at 440-880-5500 or click the link below:\nhttps://www.marriott.com/e
 n-us/hotels/yngfa-fairfield-inn-and-suites-ashtabula/overview/\n\nSchedule
 :\nFriday - check in to the hotel 3pm\, so dressed and ready to ride at 4p
 m for an evening ride north on the trail (12-15 miles) into Ashtabula and 
 the Erie Lakeshore.\n[Fairfield Inn to Lake Shore Park · Ride with GPS](h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/57249769?privacy_code=2flx9YrtZNv3L2YmF23QZw
 503AGVnpFJ)\nSaturday - finish breakfast 7:30am\, on our bikes at 7:45am t
 o ride south on the Trail\, half as far\, as we want to ride\, for the day
 \, then turn around and ride back\, stopping anywhere along the way\, "tha
 t suits our fancy".\nSunday will include a short\, morning road ride throu
 gh the countryside\, before checkout and departure.\nhttps://ridewithgps.c
 om/routes/56832661?privacy_code=bqujKSJ0Q6RnVva5ngKKNGALNqGgoyXs&via=nwBsH
 NSqHFjw0sNsdckfww\n\nWe will ride as a group. No one will be left behind.\
 n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, a
 nd basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing
  a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://
 www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour R
 SVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lan
 cbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id
 =323984) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](h
 ttps://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).\n\nAllen Pidcoe 717-487
 -1541\n\nADDITIONAL DETAILS WILL BE ADDED\, AS THEY BECOME AVAILABLE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3158826
 67/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T003536Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T003536Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
